; The in-browser entry point. Built only under the `wasm` dune profile (used by
; build-wasm.sh inside `nix develop`, which provides js_of_ocaml/wasm_of_ocaml).
; Gating keeps the default `dune build` working in a plain opam switch that has
; yojson but not js_of_ocaml. We emit plain bytecode here and let build-wasm.sh
; post-process it with the wasm_of_ocaml CLI (so we don't depend on dune's
; newer `wasm` mode). Warnings are non-fatal here (the JS FFI uses APIs that may
; be marked deprecated across js_of_ocaml versions).
(executable
 (name ablator_wasm)
 (modes byte)
 (libraries rocq_ablator js_of_ocaml)
 (flags
  (:standard -warn-error -a))
 (enabled_if
  (= %{profile} wasm)))
